{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "745b790c6d3acda6713861c91537287d7a78c5ea3ef8b9b113da96540f5f5056", "ja": "（琴葉が、ドラマでヤンデレなカフェ店員を\n演じる事になった。今は休憩時間なのだが……）", "zh": "（琴叶要在电视剧里饰演一名病娇咖啡店员。\n现在虽然是休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "2e284f8989101089d32bd277faad63ce3209e47d995df181606f54d98d0f5530", "ja": "え……うそ……。\nまさか、こんな展開って……。", "zh": "诶……不会吧……。\n难道剧情居然会发展成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6cb7301def0a7b8e3c3aa4b68f253386b07945d4450030c8b64c30cf3e01098b", "ja": "どうしたんだ、琴葉。\nドラマの台本でも読み返しているのか？", "zh": "怎么了，琴叶？  \n你是在重读电视剧的剧本吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "e77192a4534b37416ccc43404c4bd6bac4c9ad52cb926b25c0d8ff65417ab5ab", "ja": "{$P$}。お疲れさまです。\nえっと、これは台本じゃなくて……。", "zh": "{$P$}。辛苦了。\n那个，这是剧本以外的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "583a3c9372af87b4a69082769cfe9dc204a37cafd4917efffb8238f8945837d2", "ja": "まつりちゃんに貸してもらった漫画を読んでたんです。\nヤンデレの参考になるって聞いたんですけど……。", "zh": "我在看小祭借给我的漫画。\n听说这对理解病娇类型很有帮助……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1005_p", "source_sha256": "637456d2aa85a991a487f84c2915a59b7c9cbaa3b9ecd3baed174113d9acb1ef", "ja": "ヤンデレ系の……。そういう作品は、\nけっこう刺激的な内容だったりするけど……。", "zh": "病娇系的……这类作品的内容，往往都挺刺激的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "90ebfaa2f53de31ab0c33401544c3c3498c2009fc07219f998eac979c212671d", "ja": "はい……特に今読んでるのは、\n主人公への想いが強すぎて、最後に……その……。", "zh": "是的……尤其是我现在正在看的这部，  \n对主人公的感情过于强烈，最后……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c86a780e4ac557cac480060d49e924cbc378347720fc56b5d761044ace686c17", "ja": "……な、なんとなくわかったよ。\n過激な終わり方だったみたいだな。", "zh": "……大、大概明白了。\n看来结局挺过激的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "de329ab2d215255bca0f8b31f414a3904a2cd5b5bba750c0629dde059c7e22c0", "ja": "そうですね。でも、役作りの参考にはなりそうです。\nもちろん、ここまで過激な演技にはしませんけど。", "zh": "是啊。不过，似乎可以作为塑造角色的参考。\n当然，我不会演得这么激烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "2b6f91196da4ee972136da556d024fd8a011e38f3169c40f657f3a907eba98cd", "ja": "病んでしまうくらいの、強い執着……。\nでもきっと、特別じゃないんですよね。", "zh": "强烈到甚至会让人病态的执着……  \n但一定也并不特殊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "0290abcd8b618b6262692e0f27178c916459b90f5a6eeb68bfe0f6831beed440", "ja": "自分のことを一番好きになって欲しい……。\n嫌われたくない思いの裏返しなのかもって。", "zh": "想让对方最喜欢自己……也许是因为不想被讨厌，只是换了种表现方式吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fc9528f803c9deb732705fabedafbd87e92255252f1ed07b814d75acce5f777b", "ja": "なるほど。そう考えると、\n誰もが持っている感情かもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此。这样想的话，\n也许这是每个人都拥有的感情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "fbad01cec412c19e7ad790c6c074e77b6887696b959d67a9d7b0d67e953fee2c", "ja": "はい。普段はきっと\nそんな様子は見せないでしょうけど、でも……。", "zh": "是的。平时肯定不会表现出那副样子吧，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "c71219acd3180cf2ec9fecc568aa643a6858281dd3486bcdeb8aa3c7f8482ff3", "ja": "それは、気持ちに蓋をしているだけで。本当は、\n自分だけを見てほしい気持ちでいっぱいで……。", "zh": "那只是把自己的感情压抑起来了。其实，心里满是希望对方只注视着自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "920106e3d45999059ce5d4abdb57df353706a91646577a8f5958a824fe2aa021", "ja": "相手にわかってほしいのに、激しい行動が\n逆効果になることもあったりして。なんだか……。", "zh": "明明希望对方能够理解自己，可激烈的举动有时反而会适得其反。总觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1015_p", "source_sha256": "780f92b43d0f91df5f34c4c053af282b9d731e6c532978bb0d26159b91297b03", "ja": "そうか……それは辛いかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……那确实可能很难受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "65d65758125739e52c7499a8fb53b4fca5096ae3e084857b194f689ad171f1e3", "ja": "！！　{$P$}……\nわかるんですか？", "zh": "！！　{$P$}……\n您明白吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e59050b33f6fec99f45a251e93064a3f0060520b19026e9ee83afa158b69f1fd", "ja": "ああ、なんとなくな……。営業先の人が好感触でも、\n必ず仕事をくれるとは限らないとか……。", "zh": "嗯，多少能感觉到……比如说，就算客户那边的人态度不错，也不一定会把工作交给我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "15470f61f99bc95b055a564d3360bebd0399ecb6ea88a6151fab7163fd66374e", "ja": "そういう事もあるんですね。\nあ……そろそろ休憩が終わるみたいです。", "zh": "原来还会有这种情况啊。\n啊……休息时间好像差不多要结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0504_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "99cd7c98a54dbfe7ecde6496e6f730c2f0e4fcb11465b764172b310845003723", "ja": "{$P$}と話したおかげで、\n理解が深まった気がします。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "多亏了和{$P$}聊了聊，\n感觉我的理解更深了。非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
